Regenerating this file
----------------------

The crate sections derive from the Cargo graph:

    cargo tree -p kupferdraht-core -p kupferdraht-cli --target all \
        -e normal,build --prefix none --format '{p}|{l}|{r}' | sort -u

with authors from `cargo metadata`. Refresh it together with
docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html whenever the dependency graph changes;
the hand-written sections above change only when a vendored,
build-time or bindings component does. `cargo test -p kupferdraht-core
--test third_party_notices` compares this file with its sources and names
what differs.
